Folia Local
===========

This project is an Android-native, local-only reimagining of Folia.

Original project:
  Folia (folia-major)
  https://github.com/chthollyphile/folia-major
  Copyright (c) the Folia contributors
  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)

This repository is not an official Folia client and is not endorsed by the
original project. The name "Folia", the original visual design, and the
original project's assets remain the property of their respective authors.

What this project reuses conceptually:
  - The full-screen, lyrics-first playback experience.
  - The lyric style names "流光 / 浮名 / 倾诉" (Lumi / Fume / Tilt).
  - The local-library-first data model and sidecar lyric conventions.
  - The dark visual direction and accent-color-from-cover idea.

What this project does NOT include:
  - The Electron main process or the original web frontend source code.
  - Any online music provider (NetEase, QQ Music, Kugou, Spotify,
    YouTube Music, Bodian), Navidrome, AI theme generation, sync server,
    OBS/Stage/remote-control features, or mod system.
  - Any network permission or network client.

Changes made in this repository:
  - Implemented a native Android application in Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.
  - Added Storage Access Framework based local music folder scanning.
  - Added Media3 based local playback and media session.
  - Added LRC / enhanced LRC parsing and three Compose lyric renderers.
  - Added adaptive layouts for phones, tablets and foldables.
  - Removed all cloud APIs and the INTERNET permission.

